WEBVTT

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:33.980
Okay, I'm leaving now.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:36.780
Right. And don't forget this!

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:38.160
Thank you...

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:41.320
Hey, Lag...

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.540
Don't do anything too reckless, okay?

00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:48.710
I'm sorry, Sylvette.

00:01:50.120 --> 00:01:52.250
I can't make that promise.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:56.070
The Cabernet is a level above all 
the other Gaichuu I've ever faced.

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:58.550
We'll need to do everything we can.

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:06.020
We have to defeat the Cabernet, 
and get back Gauche's heart...

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:09.270
Lag... About that...

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.190
No...! It's nothing...

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:15.360
Be careful out there.

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:16.820
Thanks.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:18.980
Okay, I'm off!

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:33.400
Lawrence's Ambition

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:32.900
Master, please wait!

00:02:34.030 --> 00:02:35.650
What's the meaning of this?

00:02:35.650 --> 00:02:38.100
Going on a business trip 
at a crucial time like this?

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:41.550
Well, it was something I set 
up quite a while back, see...

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.800
I can't really go changing it at this point.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.930
But, does it have to be today? The 
day you send out those boys...?

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:51.180
I'm counting on you for the rest, Aria-kun!

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:56.360
Honestly!

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:09.540
I'll watch over her closely 
while you are out.

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:12.030
T-Thank you very much!

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:18.630
Yo! Quite a long vacation you had there.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:24.890
Pull yourself together. Let's go.

00:03:27.800 --> 00:03:28.590
Yeah!

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:35.780
Now, filling in for the Master 
who is out on a business trip,

00:03:35.780 --> 00:03:38.650
I will outline the mission 
to finish off the Cabernet.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:43.830
Relying on Gus's sense of smell, you are to 
locate where the Cabernet is concealing itself.

00:03:44.140 --> 00:03:48.540
Then you are to lure it to the surface and 
defeat it with your shinjirai and shindans.

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:51.110
You must be prepared for the unexpected.

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.670
Please, put your heart into this 
mission when you carry it out.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:55.290
That is all.

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:56.470
Right!

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:06.760
The Cabernet disappeared into 
the ground near Shark Cape.

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:11.800
The Doctor said that the Cabernet 
might head into the ground

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:13.350
to heal itself and then revive, right?

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:16.740
We've got no choice but 
to head to the Shark Cape,

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:19.090
pick up the Cabernet's 
scent, and chase after it.

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:21.160
It'll be too late if we do that!

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.530
But we don't have any other way...

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:29.570
If only we knew the direction 
that the Cabernet escaped to...

00:04:32.650 --> 00:04:33.720
There!

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:46.190
This sure is a fancy mansion you got here...

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.500
How'd you get somethin' like this?

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.780
I have Reverse supporters everywhere.

00:04:53.010 --> 00:04:55.440
They offered this to me.

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:59.670
And? What are we to do with the ones 
that weren't able to become spirit?

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:02.260
We will move them to the appointed place,

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:04.450
once the preparations are complete.

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:05.400
Preparations?

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:12.380
We will add allies and supporters 
who hate the government.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.900
Do you regret it?

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:53.950
Regret what?

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.670
You needn't worry.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.720
My heart is set.

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:14.810
My heart...

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:29.820
My heart stands with those who 
were not able to become spirit.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:35.720
You who were made sacrifices to the 
government's experiments... I want to save you.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:38.480
Noir...

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:42.250
Roda!

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:44.590
What is wrong? Roda...

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:58.510
I guess we still have a long way to go.

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:01.850
Damn it... I want to hurry 
up and defeat that Cabernet!

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:04.730
Don't we have some way to lure it out?

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:12.910
Hey, Gus...

00:07:12.910 --> 00:07:13.700
What is it?

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:14.950
What's the matter?

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.750
Whoa, whoa!

00:07:18.010 --> 00:07:19.240
Gus!

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:19.830
Hey!

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:20.770
Niche!

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:22.580
Niche!

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.780
What in the world is with him?

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:26.660
Gus was actually <i>running</i>!

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:27.830
I wonder what's the matter?

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:30.400
Gus!

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:43.880
What? The Cabernet?

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:45.190
What did you say?

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:46.640
Is that true?

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:48.810
That's what Gus is saying!

00:07:48.810 --> 00:07:51.420
He says that the Cabernet 
will awaken over there!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.410
You don't mean...

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:02.830
Cabernet is going to awaken 
in Yuusari Central?

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:05.280
T-That's...

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:07.640
It's not out of the question.

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:10.030
It's an even bigger city than Lament.

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:14.070
It wouldn't be strange for it 
to head there seeking heart.

00:08:14.070 --> 00:08:17.680
But there isn't any gaichuu 
territory in Central.

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:19.830
And it's never been attacked before, right?

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:22.100
Then, why would the Cabernet 
be the only one...

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:27.300
Because there is a strong heart in Central.

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:28.130
For example...

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.130
Strong heart?

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:34.740
Well, I'm definitely 
curious about the reason.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:40.240
But if the Cabernet has passed this 
point, it must already be pretty close.

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.010
We have to hurry.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.960
Yeah. Let's head back.

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:46.760
We have to stop the Cabernet 
from entering Central!

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:48.550
Yeah, you're right.

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:50.530
Let's head it off at the Hill of Prayer!

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:56.260
The earth is brittle over there, and it's 
the perfect place to set my yellow explosions.

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:57.720
We'll set up our defense there!

00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:58.830
Right.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:08:59.760
Yeah!

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:08.510
If we don't do something, Roda will...

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:10.520
She needs treatment.

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:14.980
They are very important lives to us.

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:20.800
Leave this to me.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.680
I have something I want you to do.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:28.790
This is...?

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:31.150
Bring them back with you.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:40.260
Going on a business trip now, of all times?

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:43.110
What in the world might 
he be thinking? The fool!

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:45.430
Master is far too easygoing!

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:50.730
It's gone...

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.390
The key to Bifrost...

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:03.630
They used to be Bees, and 
in the crash of the airship,

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:06.330
they lost their eyes and 
their younger brother.

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:11.210
As compensation, the government gave 
them their jobs as gatekeepers,

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:14.760
but it was because the government 
wished to utilize their power,

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:17.720
and to keep them in a place 
they could be watched.

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.020
Inside a cage.

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:26.650
They hate the Amberground government 
more than anything else.

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.590
We heard from one of Lawrence's messengers.

00:11:21.550 --> 00:11:22.450
Let us go.

00:11:26.170 --> 00:11:29.890
I did not think you two would have 
had a connection to Lawrence.

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:35.270
Lawrence said he would free 
us in exchange for our power.

00:11:35.270 --> 00:11:36.250
Power?

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:42.260
Even if we are separated, the two of us 
can communicate with each other's heart.

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:47.890
By using this power, we can combine the 
hearts of the ones unable to become spirit.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:52.510
Lawrence is thinking it will 
strengthen the Cabernet.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.350
To bundle hearts into one?

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:01.930
I didn't think you would be 
assisting in this plan...

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:04.430
It doesn't seem like you've been informed.

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:09.910
We... are human sacrifices.

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:17.050
Ones who were unable to become spirits 
are creatures with enhanced "heart".

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:22.470
He will gather them in one place, and that 
heart will act as feed for the Cabernet.

00:12:23.160 --> 00:12:26.010
We have been called for that purpose.

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:35.240
The ones unable to become 
spirit... will be feed?

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:51.310
The Amberground government fused all manner of 
things with humans in an attempt to create spirit.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:56.790
All in order to use the spirit energy 
to stabilize the artificial sun.

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:02.710
And the failures of those experiments are 
the ones that were unable to become spirit.

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:07.090
However, their hearts are considerably 
stronger than a human's.

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:15.270
Lawrence intends to offer those strong hearts 
to the Cabernet, greatly increasing its power,

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:18.880
and take down the artificial sun.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.580
Where's Noir?

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:36.120
He'll meet up with you as soon as he returns.

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:38.950
Giddyup!

00:13:55.450 --> 00:13:56.810
Connor!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:58.810
Be careful now!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.650
Yeah! I'm fine!

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:03.100
Let's go, Gus!

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:03.910
There.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:15.290
Shinjirai, set!

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.960
Set!

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:20.960
Set!

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:38.430
Brother...

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:45.430
Listen, Sylvette.

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:52.570
I heard from a certain person that 
Akatsuki's artificial sun steals people's hearts.

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:55.800
A heart, once lost, can never be returned?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.580
Is that true, Doctor?

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.080
I do not know.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:06.970
But according to Seeing, Suede... 
I mean, Noir tried to kill him.

00:15:12.640 --> 00:15:16.530
Perhaps his heart is already...

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:41.700
Where to?

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:43.440
To Hill of Prayer.

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:46.920
Those Bee brats picked up the scent 
and are waiting in defense there.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.220
Let's go, Hazle.

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:49.210
Sure.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.180
Good work, Noir.

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:01.850
What is it?

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:10.450
What have you done with the ones 
that weren't able to become spirit?

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:14.890
They have been moved. All that is 
left is to put the plan into action.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:16.930
Is it true?

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:17.950
What?

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:22.490
Is it true that you are gathering 
the ones who couldn't become spirit

00:16:22.490 --> 00:16:24.500
in one place as food for the Cabernet?

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:31.010
I was wondering what you were going 
to say... And you say this now?

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.210
This?

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:37.340
I thought you vowed to take down the government 
for the sake of those who couldn't become spirit!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.100
Then why must you offer their lives?

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:45.540
Their lives will serve as the cornerstone 
of the defeat of the Amberground government.

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:49.170
Thus giving vent to the hatred of 
many others who have been oppressed.

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:52.880
This will save the lives of a 
far greater number of people.

00:16:52.880 --> 00:16:56.680
For that goal, no sacrifice is too great.

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:03.250
When you join with Reverse, 
that's what you pledged, yes?

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:06.250
Those nuns...

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:09.350
And the ones who were 
unable to become spirit...

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:12.630
They should hold the same ideals as I do.

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:15.270
They loathe the government,

00:17:15.270 --> 00:17:20.890
Their hearts yearn and suffer with the 
desire to live, despite ever-encroaching death.

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:26.140
If I gather them all up into one, 
no human heart could compare!

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:31.680
The Cabernet will devour those hearts, grow 
in power, and take down the artificial sun!

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:35.290
Finally, the Ambergound government which 
caused me all those years of suffering,

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:37.030
will be destroyed by my hands!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.780
The rebirth begins!

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:55.920
Like hell you will!

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:58.830
Where have you taken them?!

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:10.230
It will be a problem if you get in the way.

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:44.450
Brother...

00:18:58.630 --> 00:18:59.700
What should we do?

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:02.990
Leave him.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:06.950
He cannot stop the plan.

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:46.700
Next: The Place I Want to Return To
